        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Upscale a Still\n\nEnlarges an image four times while reconstructing detail instead of blurring it as a plain resize would. Use it when a still has to hold up in print. It is billed per image.\n\n**How it works:** Drop a picture into \"1 Image\". \"2 Upscale 4x\" enlarges it with the upscaling model you pick, and \"3 Result\" returns the larger image.\n\n**Try this:** Set scale on \"2 Upscale 4x\" to 2 for a smaller, faster enlargement."
        },
